# Optional. Without a key the app still works end to end: the budget, timeline,
# vendor comparison and re-planning are deterministic, and the AI features fall
# back to built-in suggestions (clearly labelled as such in the UI).
#
# Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey and add it in Vercel under
# Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables (never prefix it with NEXT_PUBLIC_).
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional comma-separated model list, tried in order if a model id is rejected.
# GEMINI_MODELS=gemini-3.5-flash-lite,gemini-3.6-flash
